# Attribution and distribution notices

The Beer Detective â€” a World Beer Wiki book project.

Original narrative prose and original vector cover compositions were prepared
for this contribution in October 2026. The book uses World Beer Wiki edition
1.19, commit `3b985c19a9dcccef8d334be54b5405e42093e812`, as its research baseline.
The repository's existing Apache License, Version 2.0, accompanies this
contribution in LICENSE. No separate Creative Commons grant is asserted.

Source publications, museum objects and third-party quotations retain their
respective rights. Citation does not imply endorsement. Source articles,
photographs and archival scans are not redistributed in this package. The cover
illustration is original and does not reproduce a specific historical object.

Font software: EB Garamond and Bricolage Grotesque, obtained from the Google
Fonts repository, under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Original font
files and license notices are in design/fonts/. Build-time static instances
derive from these variable fonts and are embedded in the reading editions.
Their license notices are included as PDF attachments and EPUB package assets.

Research, drafting, internal review and production were assisted by AI.
This complete review edition has not received independent human editorial,
specialist or community review. No human author identity, reviewer, publisher
endorsement, interview or field visit is invented.

endstream
